### Get Campaign Stats
GET {{host}}/api/reports/campaigns/1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### List Calls for Campaign
POST {{host}}/api/reports/campaigns/1/calls/list
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "page": 0,
  "size": 20
}

### List All Calls
POST {{host}}/api/reports/calls/list
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "page": 0,
  "size": 20
}

### Get Call Detail
GET {{host}}/api/reports/calls/1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Dashboard KPI
GET {{host}}/api/reports/dashboard/kpi
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Dashboard Timeseries
GET {{host}}/api/reports/dashboard/timeseries
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Dashboard Outcomes
GET {{host}}/api/reports/dashboard/outcomes
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Create Report Schedule
POST {{host}}/api/reports/schedule
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "reports@example.com",
  "periodicity": "DAILY",
  "format": "pdf"
}

### List Report Schedules
POST {{host}}/api/reports/schedule/list
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "page": 0,
  "size": 10
}
